{{also|køttur}}
==Icelandic==
{{wikipedia|lang=is}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|is|non|kǫttr}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*kattuz}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈkʰœhtʏr/|[ˈkʰɵ̞ht̪ʉ̞r̥]}}
* {{rhymes|is|œhtʏr|s=2}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun/old|m|kattar|kettir}}

# A [[cat]]; a (usually domesticated) carnivorous mammal with short fur, a short snout, and retractable claws.
#: {{ux|is|Mér sýnist að þessi '''köttur''' sem þú keyptir í [[Grundarfjörður|Grundarfirði]] gæti verið vondur.|It seems to me like that '''cat''' which you bought in Grundarfjörður might be evil.}}
#: {{syn|is|flækingsköttur|heimilisköttur|húsköttur|kattardýr|stórköttur|villiköttur}}

====Declension====
{{is-decl-noun-m-s3|k|a|tt|u=u}}

